      "The king wants to invite all of them to the feast. But there is a problem. The palace only has twelve golden plates for the feast. The king does not have a thirteenth plate.",
      "\"We cannot invite the thirteenth fairy,\" the king says. \"We do not have a gold plate for her. She will be angry, but we have no choice.\"",
